stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> received: Raw delivery captured
  received --> rejected: Invalid signature / malformed request
  received --> duplicate: Delivery ID already seen
  received --> queued: Envelope persisted
  queued --> processing: Worker claims event
  processing --> delivered: Downstream succeeds
  processing --> retry_scheduled: Transient failure
  retry_scheduled --> processing: Backoff elapsed
  processing --> dead_lettered: Retry budget exhausted
  delivered --> replayed_local: Developer creates safe replay
  dead_lettered --> replayed_approved: Operator-approved recovery
  replayed_local --> queued
  replayed_approved --> queued
